  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Inter-Slice Reducer",
      "source_hash": 2641367134730211831,
      "context_hash": 10716555263414569786,
      "translation": "Inter-Slice Reducer",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Inter-Slice Reducer": "Inter-Slice Reducer",
        "Slice": "Slice"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771686Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Inter-Slice Reducer reduces a tensor across the 256 slices in a cluster.",
      "source_hash": 5933491785225205318,
      "context_hash": 5437185237146760334,
      "translation": "Inter-Slice Reducer는 Cluster 내 256개의 Slice에 걸쳐 텐서를 리덕션합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Inter-Slice Reducer": "Inter-Slice Reducer",
        "Cluster": "Cluster",
        "Slice": "Slice"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It preserves `Chip`, `Cluster`, and `Packet`, and rewrites `Slice` and `Time` into `OutSlice` and `OutTime`.",
      "source_hash": 11146641795728984317,
      "context_hash": 9874379418609518441,
      "translation": "`Chip`, `Cluster`, `Packet`은 그대로 유지하며, `Slice`와 `Time`은 `OutSlice`와 `OutTime`으로 다시 씁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The output tensor is always `Way8` regardless of the input mode.",
      "source_hash": 6393858934205486973,
      "context_hash": 3698816691464205743,
      "translation": "출력 텐서는 입력 모드와 관계없이 항상 `Way8`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Interface",
      "source_hash": 7655632546613034002,
      "context_hash": 9466603923670335303,
      "translation": "인터페이스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The reducer can be entered right after `vector_init()` (the `InterFirst` path, shown below) or from a [compatible intra-slice stage](./intra-slice-chain.md#transitioning-to-the-inter-slice-reducer) (the `IntraFirst` path, with the same `vector_inter_slice_reduce()` method called on the intra-slice tensor).",
      "source_hash": 16355397601446278148,
      "context_hash": 18276816039715327513,
      "translation": "이 리듀서는 `vector_init()` 직후에 진입할 수도 있고(`InterFirst` 경로, 아래에 표시됨), [호환되는 intra-slice 단계](./intra-slice-chain.md#transitioning-to-the-inter-slice-reducer)에서 진입할 수도 있습니다(`IntraFirst` 경로, intra-slice 텐서에서 동일한 `vector_inter_slice_reduce()` 메서드를 호출함).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Slice": "Slice",
        "stage": "단계"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The signatures shown below are the `VectorInitTensor` variants.",
      "source_hash": 16071131228799535007,
      "context_hash": 11476716181874016808,
      "translation": "아래에 표시된 시그니처는 `VectorInitTensor` 변형입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The same methods also exist on intra-slice tensors at the stages that support the transition, so the call site looks identical.",
      "source_hash": 14109332454865879204,
      "context_hash": 12960480600906797514,
      "translation": "동일한 메서드가 전환을 지원하는 단계의 intra-slice 텐서에도 존재하므로, 호출 위치는 동일하게 보입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "stages": "단계",
        "Slice": "Slice"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The inter-slice reducer provides separate APIs for `i32` and `f32`.",
      "source_hash": 15564735526838873961,
      "context_hash": 1105286653187791285,
      "translation": "Inter-Slice Reducer는 `i32`와 `f32`에 대해 별도의 API를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Slice": "Slice",
        "Inter-Slice Reducer": "Inter-Slice Reducer"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:16.771688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
